                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Dont get excited like I did and expect something really good. This is basically two movies (that I can find anyway) strung together with a tiny, super short and uninspiring few seconds of flight hanging from a parachute. It looks great for 5 seconds until you realise that you are not really in control and are not going anywhere cool. In fact, it will soon fade to black and show you two fairly dull 360 films. If these two films were on any of the 360 movie services they would not be high ranking I think. Its free, and it shows the potential of VR, but does nothing to move the genre forward. Shame, I was expecting much more. I gave it a thumbs up because its free. Cant complain when its free, I feel.",
